<div class="p-4 bg-white border border-amber-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center">Overall Taste</div>
<div class="p-4 bg-white border border-amber-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center">Smoothness</div>
<div class="p-4 bg-white border border-amber-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center">Opening Exp.</div>
<div class="p-4 bg-white border border-amber-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center">Design</div>
<div class="p-4 bg-white border border-amber-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center">Ingredients</div>
<div class="p-4 bg-white border border-amber-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center">Price</div>
<div class="p-4 bg-white border border-amber-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center">Availability</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="animate-on-scroll bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-amber-200">
<h3 class="font-bold text-soda-dark mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="clipboard-list" class="text-amber-600"></i> Scoring Rubric</h3>
<ul class="space-y-4 text-stone-600">
<li class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-amber-100 pb-2">Max Points Per Metric<span class="font-mono font-bold text-lg">5.0</span></li>
<li class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-amber-100 pb-2">Total Possible Score<span class="font-mono font-bold text-xl text-amber-600">40.0</span></li>
</ul>
<div class="mt-8 p-5 bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-sm text-amber-900 italic shadow-inner rounded-r-lg">"The primary objective was to move beyond subjective preference by quantifying the trade-off inherent in the market."</div>
