<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-soda-dark mb-3 border-b border-amber-200 pb-2">Sugar is King</h3>
<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Superior sensory experiences (Creaminess, Taste) are overwhelmingly linked to traditional, caloric sweeteners like <strong class="text-amber-700">Honey</strong> or <strong class="text-amber-700">Cane Sugar</strong>.</p>
