<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Zero-calorie alternatives consistently achieve high ingredient marks but fail dramatically in texture and flavor. Current technology cannot replicate the "Cream" profile.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-8 bg-cream-50 text-stone-800 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-amber-100 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-soda-dark mb-3 border-b border-amber-200 pb-2">Economy Paradox</h3>
<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Surprisingly, "Great Value" (Walmart) outperformed many mid-tier brands, proving that generic HFCS formulations often beat poorly executed "healthy" sodas.</p>
