<div class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl mb-2 tracking-wider text-white">CRSI</div>
<p class="text-xs max-w-sm">Clouty Skies Research Institute. Dedicated to Investigating what Mainstream Academia is TOO AFRAID to.</p>
</div>
